<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">This "Natural Sparsity Principle" arises from biology: metabolic costs (ATP) and noise favor high-salience modes.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" class="text-xl">2.3 Comparative Valence and Catharsis Critique</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Valence is relative: tilt <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Î¾</mi><mo separator="true">;</mo><mi>Î¸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Î¾</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>âˆ’</mo><mo stretchy="false">âŸ¨</mo><mi>Î¸</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Î¾</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">âŸ©</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{\text{ref}}(\xi; \theta) = F(\xi) - \langle \theta, C(\xi) \rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">F</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">â€‹</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.04601em;">Î¾</span><span class="mpunct">;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">Î¸</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">F</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.04601em;">Î¾</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">âˆ’</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">âŸ¨</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">Î¸</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.04601em;">Î¾</span><span class="mclose">)âŸ©</span></span></span></span>, yielding <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi><mo>âˆ’</mo><mi>Î¸</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla \Phi_{\text{eff}} = \nabla \Phi - \theta \nabla C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord">âˆ‡</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Î¦</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">â€‹</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7667em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">âˆ‡Î¦</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">âˆ’</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">Î¸</span><span class="mord">âˆ‡</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span>.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Lemma B.3 (Reference-Tilt Lemma).</strong></p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Valence: <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo>â‹…</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">/</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V = (\mathbf{v} \cdot \nabla \Phi) / (\|\mathbf{v}\| \|\nabla \Phi\|)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">â‹…</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">âˆ‡Î¦</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">/</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">âˆ¥</span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span><span class="mord">âˆ¥âˆ¥âˆ‡Î¦âˆ¥</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>.</li>
<li class="break-words">Tilt shifts direction without altering magnitudes if balanced.</li>
<li class="break-words">Thus, <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Î¸</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">Î¸</span></span></span></span> changes <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span> at constant <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span> (dissipation unchanged).</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Any situation can be "sad" or "pleasant" via comparison (<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Î¸</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">Î¸</span></span></span></span>).</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Catharsis: forcing <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="bold">e</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k \mathbf{e}_A &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8444em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">e</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">â€‹</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&gt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>. Reduce to modes <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">a</span></span></span></span> (arousal amplitude), <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annota