</span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(367.2px);"><span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\title</span><span>{From Catharsis to Geometric Bayesian Emotion: RSVP and the Demise of the Hydraulic Model}
</span></span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(388.8px);"><span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\author</span><span>{Anonymous}
</span></span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(410.4px);"><span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\date</span><span>{}
