</span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(2764.8px);"><span><span>The RSVPâ€“GBSH principles extend beyond emotion to linguistic and logical evolution. Affordance-based classifiers (small-round, flowing, alive) consolidate into gender systems under predictive compression and cultural tilts </span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\(</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\psi</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 192, 123);">_</span><span>{</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\text</span><span>{bin}}</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\)</span><span>.
