</span></span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(2376px);"><span>Information geometry uses Riemannian metrics to describe statistical manifolds. Optimization under constraints (KKT) models resource-limited systems. Prerequisites: Differential geometry, Lagrange multipliers.
