</span></span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(3240px);"><span>Reframing is like adjusting your map to see a new path out of a valley, avoiding extra energy. Venting, however, is like spinning in place, making the valley deeper and harder to escape.
