</span></span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(1360.8px);"><span><span>Define fields over </span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\(</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\Omega</span><span> </span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\subset</span><span> </span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\mathbb</span><span>{R}</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 192, 123);">^</span><span>3</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\)</span><span>, with boundary </span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\(</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\Gamma</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\)</span><span>:
